sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Import UI
    participant API as Data API
    participant Parser as File Parser
    participant Queue as Job Queue
    participant Worker as Import Worker
    participant DB as Database
    participant Audit as Audit Service

    User->>UI: Chọn loại + upload CSV/Excel
    UI->>API: POST /imports/preview
    API->>Parser: Parse, map, validate
    Parser-->>API: 5 dòng mẫu + valid/errors
    API-->>UI: PreviewResult
    UI-->>User: Hiển thị thống kê và lỗi
    User->>UI: Xác nhận import dòng hợp lệ
    UI->>API: POST /imports/{token}/confirm
    API->>Queue: Enqueue import job
    Queue-->>API: jobId
    API-->>UI: 202 Accepted + jobId
    Queue->>Worker: Process job
    loop Theo batch
      Worker->>DB: Insert/update valid rows trong transaction
      Worker->>Audit: Ghi audit summary
    end
    Worker-->>Queue: completed(validCount, errorCount)
    UI->>API: GET /jobs/{jobId}
    API-->>UI: Progress/result
    UI-->>User: Toast kết quả import

